OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects to be released on
OL,4,Abail, head of counter-terror police
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe men - all UK nationals in their 20s
OL,8,Fwho live in London - were arrested
OL,9,Funder the Explosives Act and on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of preparing a terrorist act
OL,12,FCounter-terror police say they are
OL,13,F"very aware of the levels of
OL,14,Fspeculation about the motivation behind
OL,15,Fthis incident, and the geopolitical
OL,16,Fquestions that are being raised". The
OL,17,FIranian embassy in the UK denies any
OL,18,Finvolvement
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
