OL,3,ATrump-Xi summit: What wasn't said might
OL,4,Amatter the most
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, China released more
OL,7,Finformation of what was agreed at the
OL,8,Ftalks between Xi Jinping and Donald
OL,9,FTump last week, shedding light on a
OL,10,Fhandful of concrete outcomes.
OL,12,FBut there were no joint statements and
OL,13,Ffew major breakthroughs.
OL,15,FInstead, both governments issued
OL,16,Fseparate accounts of the meeting -
OL,17,Fperhaps a sign that despite the White
OL,18,FHouse tours and promise of warmer ties,
OL,19,FWashington and Beijing remain wary of
OL,20,Feach other.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
